### Styles

Include the base styles and fonts once at the top of your app entry point:

```js
// index.js
import '@gravity-ui/uikit/styles/fonts.css';
import '@gravity-ui/uikit/styles/styles.css';
```

A SCSS [mixins](styles/mixins.scss) file with useful helpers is also available for use in your own stylesheets.

### Guides

Read more:

- [Migration to v8](docs/migration-to-v8.md) — the breaking changes of v8 and the way through each of them
- [Layout components and spacings](docs/layout.md) — compose responsive pages with the shared grid
